description:
Drive a Moscow metro train, transport passengers, explore stations!
Metro lines:
- Kalininskaya (8) (Tretyakovskaya, Marksistskaya, Ploshchad Ilyicha, Aviamotornaya, Shosse Entuziastov, Perovo, Novogireyevo, Novokosino)

Trains:
- "Nomernoy" 81-717/714;
- "Oka" 81-760/761;
- Wagon type "E" 81-703;
- "Moscow" 81-765/766.

Informant: the real records of the informant of the Moscow metro.

Game Modes:
- Driver mode: control the Moscow metro train;
- Training: learn how to drive a train.

Ready for a challenging puzzle that tests your logic and tactics? Welcome to "2048 Puzzle: Connect the Balls"! 
Game Features:
Aim and shoot balls to connect;
Use bombs to clear balls;
Score points, set records, and outplay others!
Spend your time wisely and show off your intellectual skills in "2048 Puzzle: Connect the Balls"!
